31","lt":"pub","doi":"10.1509/jmr.09.0531"},{"t":"When Trade-Offs Matter: The Effect of Choice Construal on Context Effects","a":["Uzma Khan","Meng Zhu","Ajay Kalra"],"y":2011,"c":"pub","j":"Journal of Marketing Research","v":"48","i":"1","p":"62-71","r":106,"l":"https://doi.org/10.1509/jmkr.48.1.62","lt":"pub","doi":"10.1509/jmkr.48.1.62"}]